      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Rule (hooks-service-dao.mdc): Rel arrows to DAOs are shorthand \u2014 real chain is component \u2192 hook \u2192 service \u2192 DAO.\nLessonGenerationDao + PdfUploadDao invoke Edge Functions; PdfDocumentsDao talks to Postgres/Storage directly. Hooks default to TanStack Query\n(useLessonGeneration is a named exemption).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rule (hooks-service-dao.mdc): Rel arrows to DAOs are shorthand \u2014 real chain is component \u2192 hook \u2192 service \u2192 DAO.\nLessonGenerationDao + PdfUploadDao invoke Edge Functions; PdfDocumentsDao talks to Postgres/Storage directly. Hooks default to TanStack Query\n(useLessonGeneration is a named exemption).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
